.SH "NAME"
mate-display-properties \- customize MATE display behavor
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.HP \w'\fBmate-display-properties\ \fR\fB[mate-std-options]\fR\fB
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
\fBmate\-display\-properties\fR
The MATE display preference tool enables you to customize the screen resolution
and refresh rate for your desktop\&.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.PP
The following options are supported:
\fBmate-std-options\fR
Standard options available for use most MATE applications.
See \fBmate-std-options\fR(5) for more information.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.PP
Example 1: Launching the \fBmate-display-properties\fR tool
.PP
example% \fBmate-display-properties\fR
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.PP
The following exit status are returned:
.PP
0
Application exited successfully
.PP
>0
Application exited with failure
.SH "FILES"
.PP
The following files are used by this application:
.PP
/usr/bin/\fBmate-display-properties\fR
.PP
Executable for mate-display-properties
